  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Transforms the caster into an animal of any size. More than one form can be learned.</p><p>The animal sets the doctrine type and the bonuses to health, combat, attributes and damage. The doctrine level follows the caster's magical doctrine, and the base combat value their Channeling.</p><p>Reverting keeps the caster's current Health. If Health drops to 0, the caster reverts with 1 Health and the Incapacitated effect. Non-animals such as Draconids cannot be taken as forms.</p>",
